  "recommended_experiment": {
    "experiment_id": "fastsam_imgsz_proposal_ab",
    "implement_now": false,
    "rationale": "Stand 677 is detected because FastSAM isolates a compact in-parcel pool mask that CLIP scores 0.99. Re-running frozen OS v1 on native15 crops that match OS crop_wh reproduces no_pool_candidate on all nine misses. On those crops FastSAM still proposes 27\u201384 masks, but the masks that reach CLIP are roof/shadow-like (max CLIP pool 0.19, then roof_gate). Water-seed priors exist on 5/9 and have high HSV water fraction, yet CLIP pool is 0.004\u20130.039 because those seeds are irregular (fail water_shape). 339 never reaches CLIP (29/32 masks <40 px). The measured gap vs 677 is proposal isolation at imgsz=512, not a missing CLIP class for turquoise water. A single controlled A/B of FastSAM imgsz (512 vs 768/1024) on the same native15 crops, with CLIP/geometry/parcel gates frozen, is the evidence-supported next experiment.",
    "controlled_knobs": [
      "FastSAM predict imgsz 512 (frozen) vs 768 and/or 1024",
      "same native15 crops",
      "CLIP, geometry, parcel, water_seed thresholds unchanged"
    ],
    "frozen_baseline": "OS v1 + FastSAM-s imgsz=512 retina_masks=True CPU + native15",
    "success_criterion": "Recover materially more of the nine known false-negative pools without materially increasing false YES on known negative/shadow/neighbour cases (Stand 570 shadow/object, neighbour-pool 1/335 1/379 395 547, confirmed NO 1/355).",
    "negative_controls": [
      "570",
      "1/335",
      "1/379",
      "395",
      "547",
      "1/355"
    ],
    "alternative_if_imgsz_fails": "water-seed morphology / compactness recovery A/B (do not combine with imgsz in the same experiment)"
  },
  "why_text": "Stand 677 is OS CONFIRMED because FastSAM produced an in-parcel mask that CLIP scored as pool (frozen CLIP 0.99, ~41x27 px). Of the nine documented misses, 1 have no FastSAM mask covering the visually identified pool, so OS v1 never saw a candidate (`no_pool_candidate`). 8 had a proposal that downstream filters discarded. Colour is not assumed to be the cause; this is measured proposal vs filter behaviour.",
